Subject: [PATCH v3 41/51] powerpc/PCI: Add IORESOURCE_MEM_64 for 64-bit
 resource in of parsing
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2015 16:29:59 -0700
Message-Id: <1438039809-24957-42-git-send-email-yinghai@kernel.org>
In-Reply-To: <1438039809-24957-1-git-send-email-yinghai@kernel.org>
